@startuml 04-activity-ci-pipeline
title CI/CD Pipeline Flow (.github/workflows/ci.yml)

start
:Trigger: pull request to main, push to main, or manual run;
:1. Checkout + set up JDK 21 (Maven cache);
:2. Render PlantUML diagrams to SVG;
if (Diagram syntax error?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
:3. Unit tests (mvn test);
if (Any unit test fails?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
:4. Integration / regression tests\n(Testcontainers: Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB);
if (Any integration test fails?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
:5. JaCoCo coverage report + gate;
if (Line coverage < 80%?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
:6a. Trivy dependency scan;
if (CRITICAL vulnerability?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
:8. Build Docker image (non-root);
:6b. Trivy image scan (OS + libraries);
if (CRITICAL vulnerability?) then (yes)
  #pink:Fail build;
  stop
endif
#palegreen:Pipeline green;
:9. Upload reports (tests, coverage, scans) and rendered SVGs\n(always, also on failure);
stop

@enduml
